<PageLayout title={'Highest Standards'} description={'CEM is absolutely committed to ensuring that our data and reports are professional and 100% accurate. CEM’s quality assurance monitoring well exceeds all…'} sidebar="about">
  <p>CEM is absolutely committed to ensuring that our data and reports are professional and 100% accurate. CEM&#8217;s quality assurance monitoring well exceeds all mandated guidelines so our clients can be fully confident in our results.</p>
  <ul>
  <li>Our laboratories run quality control samples consisting of blanks, duplicate analyses, spiked analyses, and independent standard verification samples.</li>
  <li>The microscopy laboratory quality checks 20% of all samples, double the industry rate.</li>
  <li>Our CEM Industrial Hygiene Database System processes and transfers much of our client&#8217;s data automatically to minimize typographical errors that may occur during manual data entry.</li>
  <li>All reports and written documentation are quality control checked by at least two other individuals (besides the person who generated the document) to ensure that vital data is not only correct in our database but also in each written document given to our clients.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
